  "bio": {
    "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
    "text": "Vishweshwar Hegde Kageri is an Indian politician and the incumbent Member of Parliament of Uttara Kannada Lok Sabha constituency. He is a member of the Bharatiya Janata Party in Karnataka. He was a six-term and former Member of the Karnataka Legislative Assembly.\nHe served as the Minister for Primary and Secondary Education from 2008 to 2013 in the Government of Karnataka.\nHe also served as the 16th Speaker of the Karnataka Legislative Assembly from 31 June 2019 to 20 May 2023.",
